# The OBJ golden fixture is a byte-for-byte record of what the exporter
# writes, and the exporter always joins lines with "\n". With core.autocrlf
# on (the default on Windows), a checkout would rewrite it to CRLF and the
# golden comparison would fail for a reason that has nothing to do with the
# exporter. Never let git touch its line endings.
packages/panel-catalog/src/objGolden.fixture.obj -text
